# 📊 Statistical Distribution Analysis

## 📖 Overview

This project performs statistical distribution analysis on transaction data using Python. The notebook explores different probability distributions, data transformations, normality testing, and visualization techniques to understand the behavior of transaction amounts.

---

## 🚀 Features

* 📈 Data Exploration and Cleaning
* 🎲 Bernoulli Distribution Analysis
* 🔢 Binomial Distribution Analysis
* 📊 Poisson Distribution Analysis
* 📉 Log-Normal Distribution Fitting
* 📐 Power Law Distribution Analysis
* 📋 Q-Q Plot Visualization
* 🔄 Box-Cox Transformation
* 📏 Z-Score Analysis
* 📈 PDF (Probability Density Function)
* 📉 CDF (Cumulative Distribution Function)
* 🏆 Best-Fit Distribution Selection

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

* Python
* Pandas
* NumPy
* Matplotlib
* Seaborn
* SciPy
* Jupyter Notebook

---

## 📂 Project Structure

```text
Statistical_Distribution_Analysis.ipynb
README.md
data/
